From: HardDinD
Subject: [PATCH] um: make GPU worker completion schedulable

Opt-in gpu_async_wait=1 uses the worker control socket and a guest IRQ.
Keep the same host worker identity and one outstanding request per mm.
GPU command coverage is unchanged; waits are schedulable, not cancellable.
The diagnostic delay applies equally to sync/async paths and is default off.

